============================================================================================
MONTE CARLO -- 90/60 versus 100% global equities
============================================================================================

Sample A: global monthly reconstruction, 1990-07-31..2026-07-31, 433 months, 12-month blocks
          equity  8.49%/yr, bond leg +2.30%/yr, cash  2.57%/yr
Sample B: US annual 1928-2025, 98 years, 4-year blocks
          equity 10.02%/yr, bond leg +1.12%/yr, cash  3.37%/yr

20,000 paths per horizon, paired draws, costs 0.27%/yr charged to the 90/60 leg only.

